  <processinfo id="aspace_4da7bc6cee57df62b5d2e1558ece39b2">
    <head>Processing Information</head>
<p>At the time of accessioning materials were rehoused into acid-free folders and boxes. Materials were described on the collection-level and inventoried at the file-level. Photographs were rehoused into archival sleeves. Two floppy disks were identified, physically separated, inventoried, forensically imaged, determined to be blank, and appraised out of the collection.</p>  </processinfo>
